n。forecast reason：no_samples, capacity_unknown, ledger_capacity_unknown, credits_conversion_missing, usd_samples_missing, reading_stale, window_unknown。risk 取 ok/low_reserve/critical/exhausted/unknown；risk_basis 取 tasks/usd/fraction/none；tasks_left_basis 取 tasks/usd/none。阈值表：tasks 依据 <=0 exhausted、1..2 critical、3..5 low_reserve、>=6 ok；fraction 依据 <=0 exhausted、<0.05 critical、<0.15 low_reserve、其余 ok；优先级 tasks > usd > fraction > unknown。可用性取 unverified/callable/blocked/unavailable/deprecated；identity 取 verified/unverified/mismatch。semantic_change：forecast.tasks_left、forecast.risk、handle.cli_removed、draft_reason_mapping、config_v1_to_v2。【6 额度池】{id:'claude:plan-5h', cli:'claude', kind:'plan_window', funding:'plan', window:{length_s:18000, anchor:'rolling', start_at:'...', reset_at:'...', reset_source:'cli|config|estimated|unknown'}, capacity_mtok:{'claude:claude-opus-5-5':{value:2, source:'config'}, 'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5':{value:10, source:'measured', confidence:'medium'}}, used_fraction:{value:0.5, source:'cli', at:'...'}, credits_per_mtok:null}。kind 取 plan_window/plan_weekly/credits/prepaid_usd；funding 取 plan/paid。v1 配置的 quotas 映射：remaining_pct 映射为计划内池，used=1-pct/100；remaining+credits 映射为 credits 池；remaining_usd 映射为 prepaid_usd 池；unit tokens 映射为容量已知的池。【7 forecast v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.forecast/v1', status:'known|unknown', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, pools:[{pool_id:'claude:plan-5h', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, reset_at:'...', reset_in_h:3, reset_source:'cli'}], tokens_per_task:{p25:0.05, p50:0.2, p90:0.9, n:12}, tasks_left:5, tasks_left_basis:'tasks', tasks_left_assumed:null, burn_mtok_per_hour:1.1, eta_exhaust_at:'...', exhausts_before_reset:false, risk:'ok', risk_basis:'tasks', confidence:'medium', reason:null, burn_per_task:0.42, samples:12}。公式：remaining(m)=min_p cap_p(m)*(1-clamp(used_p))；有新鲜读数（age<=reading_ttl_s，默认 600）时 used_p=reading+sum(读数之后的行) tokens_i/(cap_p(model_i)*1e6)，否则为窗口内同样求和；窗口内任一行模型容量未知时为 unknown(ledger_capacity_unknown)。计费 tokens=input+output+cache_write+cache_read_weight*cache_read，权重默认 0。分位数 nearest-rank：sorted[ceil(p*n)-1]，n>=3；Heavy/Normal/Light 取 p90/p50/p25。tasks_left=floor(remaining/分位数)。样本不足时 tasks_left 为 null，tasks_left_assumed=floor(remaining/policy.usage_estimate_mtok[usage])，confidence 为 none，risk 只能来自 fraction 或为 unknown。confidence：n=0 none，1..4 low，5..19 medium，>=20 high（变异系数>1 降为 medium）。burn=窗口内已用 Mtok\n\nStderr: (empty)\nExit Code: 0\nSignal: (none)"}],"is_error":false,"_meta":{"rawResponse":{"exitCode":0,"signal":null,"interrupted":false,"sandboxDenied":false,"stderrBytesTruncated":0,"stdoutBytesTruncated":0,"tool_error_code":"0"},"renderer":{"type":"text","value":"apshot.json，snapshot_version:1，自包含，运行时不读 .collab）】每个码为 {code, exit, http_status, retryable, trigger_id, trigger}，trigger_id 全表唯一。退出码：0 成功（含 truncated）；1 E_INTERNAL；2 E_REQUEST_INVALID, E_LEVEL_REQUIRED, E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, E_SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, E_UNSAFE_ARG, E_UNKNOWN_COMMAND, E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；3 E_CONFIG, E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE, E_CONFIG_EXISTS, E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE, E_SECRET_BACKEND；4 E_STATE_LOCKED, E_TIMEOUT（可重试）；5 E_NO_CANDIDATE, E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA（可重试）；6 E_LEASE_UNKNOWN, E_LEASE_EXPIRED（可重试，需重新申请）, E_LEASE_CONSUMED, E_LEASE_CONFIG_MISMATCH；7 E_PROVIDER_AUTH, E_PROVIDER_QUOTA, E_PROVIDER_FAILED；8 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED, E_LOOPBACK_ONLY, E_READONLY, E_CSRF（HTTP 403）；9 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED, E_SMOKE_DISABLED。403 类触发条件（互斥）：E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN=select_view_without_admin（select 路由请求 full 或 draft 视图而无有效会话；CLI 的 models select 带 view:full）；E_LOOPBACK_ONLY=bootstrap_non_loopback（api/session 或 ui 外壳的 loopback 三项校验任一失败）；E_ADMIN_REQUIRED=admin_route_no_session（管理读写路由无有效会话，含过期）；E_READONLY=write_route_readonly（会话有效、插件 readonly、写路由）；E_CSRF=write_route_csrf_invalid（会话有效、可写、csrf 缺失或不匹配）。写路由判定顺序：会话 > readonly > csrf > 请求体校验。警告码：W_FIELD_IGNORED, W_FIELD_DEPRECATED, W_CONFIG_V1, W_STALE_DATA, W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED, W_MODELS_MANUAL_REQUIRED, W_LEGACY_USAGE, W_TEST_CLOCK。v1 拒选原因：excluded, level_misma