st_clock:false}，不含 provider 细节。所有 HTTP 响应与 CLI 输出共用 lib/contract/scan.mjs 检查。【13 CLI】init | paths | doctor | discover [--full] [--probe-unknown] | models enumerate|list|add|allow|deny|level|alias|probe|forecast|select | admin select | pools list|set | usage record|summary|import | cli resolve --model <key> --cwd <p> [--platform win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>] [--readonly] | run --lease <id> --state-dir <d> --config <c> | auth set <cli> [--from-env NAME]（不加时从 stdin 读）|status|clear | config migrate --in <v1> --out <v2> | state backup|restore|migrate |\n\nStderr: (empty)\nExit Code: 0\nSignal: (none)"}],"is_error":false,"_meta":{"rawResponse":{"exitCode":0,"signal":null,"interrupted":false,"sandboxDenied":false,"stderrBytesTruncated":0,"stdoutBytesTruncated":0,"tool_error_code":"0"},"renderer":{"type":"text","value":"/max(距窗口起点小时数,1/60)；eta=now+remaining/burn；输出保留 3 位小数，四舍五入远离零。容量学习：只用 Δfraction>=0.01 的读数对，cap=sum(tokens)/sum(Δfraction)/1e6，k<3 low，3..9 medium，>=10 high。所有 now 均取自 ctx.clock.now()。【8 选模策略】est 取分位数，样本不足时取 assumed；avail_p=remaining_p-有效预留-(importance 为 normal 时 reserve_fraction_for_high*cap_p)。A 类：计划内池全部已知且 min avail>=est，按紧迫度 min_p remaining_p/max(reset_in_h_p,0.25) 降序，再按价格升序、key 升序。B 类：计划内剩余未知且 unknown_policy 为 after_known，按 key 升序。C 类：付费池已知且 >=est，标 funding paid，按价格升序、key 升序。count>1 时先按 identity_group 去重贪心选，再按顺序补齐。【9 用量行 cliworker.usage/v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.usage/v1', id:'u_1', idempotency_key:'l_7d1e:post', lease_id:'l_7d1e', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', pools:['claude:plan-5h'], kind:'task|probe|manual', input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300, cache_read_tokens:0, cache_write_tokens:0, cost_usd:0.0081, pool_fraction_before:0.48, pool_fraction_after:0.5, at:'...'}。同一 idempotency_key 写入返回已有 id，读取只计一次。【10 model/v1 与 inventory/v1】model：{schema:'cliworker.model/v1', key, id, cli, provider, vendor, aliases, allowed, level, level_source:{kind:'config|measured|cli', ref, at}, availability:{state, reason, at, ttl_s, evidence:{probe_id, cmd_redacted, exi