s_at:'...'}，只存内存，TTL 为 policy.session_ttl_s，进程重启失效，仅用请求头 x-cliworker-session 与 x-cliworker-csrf，不用 cookie。管理读：GET /cliworker/providers、/models、/forecast?model=<key>、/api/snapshot?since=<rev>、/api/jobs/<id>，无有效会话返回 403 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED。管理写：POST /cliworker/api/discover|enumerate|probe|read-usage（返回 job_id）、allow|deny|level|alias|manual-model|pool、secret（只写，响应仅 state:'set'）；判定顺序：无有效会话 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED，readonly E_READONLY，csrf 缺失或不匹配 E_CSRF，请求体非法 E_REQUEST_INVALID。公共：GET /cliworker/health 返回 {status:'ok|degraded', checks:[{id, ok, detail}], registration:'ok|failed', test_clock:false}，不含 provider 细节。所有 HTTP 响应与 CLI 输出共用 lib/contract/scan.mjs 检查。【13 CLI】init | paths | doctor | discover [--full] [--probe-unknown] | models enumerate|list|add|allow|deny|level|alias|probe|forecast|select | admin select | pools list|set | usage record|summary|import | cli resolve --model <key> --cwd <p> [--platform win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>] [--readonly] | run --lease <id> --state-dir <d> --config <c> | auth set <cli> [--from-env NAME]（不加时从 stdin 读）|status|clear | config migrate --in <v1> --out <v2> | state backup|restore|migrate |"}}}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3","_messageId":"01a1b6ef01b676fda0f1bce94c01bc5b","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6ef01b676fda0f1bce94c01bc5b","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6ef01b676fda0f1bce94c01bc5b","traceparent":"00-e2db99401a709910f956cc03bd750ebc-3271128b70b8e57d-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6ec-e364-796a-b544-183433e5f1dd,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:54:41.053Z"}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b6ef-08ac-76d2-b58d-a7429b8a82ff","session_id":"01a1b6ec-e364-796a-b544-183433e5f1dd","message":{"id":"01a1b6ef08ac76d2b58da740644c3598","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the interface details. Handle v1: {schema, handle_id, lease_id, level, label, readonly, expires_at, call}. Full adds detail.\n\nNote the design's list for handle.v1 didn't mention level/label/readonly, but says \"handle-full.v1: handle.v1 的全部字段加必需的 detail\". The example in interfaces includes level, label, readonly. I'll include all: schema, handle_id, lease_id, level, label, readonly, expires_at, call.\n\nselection-ok: schema 'cliworker.selection/v1', ok, request_id, level, usage, count_requested, count_returned, truncated, shortfall, models, calls, rejected, warnings, error, generated_at. Required per example... Design says: `ok` const true; models/calls/rejected/warnings/error/truncated/shortfall/count_requested/count_returned/generated_at with constraints. I'll require: schema, ok, request_id, models, calls, truncated, shortfall, rejected, error (like failed). And optional level, usage, count_requested, count_returned, warnings, generated_at. Hmm, design says \"`truncated` 布尔；`shortfall`、`count_requested`、`count_returned` 整数 ≥0；`generated_at` ISO\". To be safe require the full set from the example: schema, ok, request_id, level, usage, count_requested, count_returned, truncated, shortfall, models, calls, rejected, warnings, error, generated_at. But then valid example must include all. That's fine — I control examples. But downstream tasks might produce views without level... The design says fields \"完全取自 interfaces 对应小节的示例；示例里有值的字段全部 required\". The example has all those with values. So require all 15. Hmm, but failure example has fewer (that's selection-failed, separate).\n\nWait, careful: for selection-ok, warnings may be empty array (still a value). OK.\n\nselection-failed: required schema, ok, request_id, models, calls, truncated, shortfall, rejected, error (per design). Optional level, usage, count_requested, count_returned, warnings, generated_at.\n\nevent.v1: required schema, seq, lease_id, type, at; optional ok, exit_code, text, usage{input_tokens,output_tokens}, code, retryable, message. additionalProperties false? Design says \"其余 ... 全部可选\". Set additionalProperties false.\n\nforecast.v1: required many, additionalProperties true. Types. pools array of {pool_id, remaining_mtok, remaining_fraction, reset_at, reset_in_h, reset_source}. tokens_per_task object {p25,p50,p90,n} — allowed arbitrary? I'd define object with those numeric props, additionalProperties false? Design doesn't say. Keep it as object type with properties... but required only \"第7节全部键\". tokens_per_task is in the example with p25,p50,p90,n. I'll make it an object with those 4 required numbers. tasks_left integer|null; tasks_left_assumed number|null; burn numeric|null; eta string|null; exhausts_before_reset boolean|null; confidence enum; reason null or forecast_reasons enum; burn_per_task number|null; samples integer (≥0). numeric fields allow null.\n\nHmm \"数值字段允许 null\" → use type [\"number\",\"null\"] etc.\n\nusage.v1: additionalProperties true; required all keys from §9 example: schema,id,idempotency_key,lease_id,model,pools,kind,input_tokens,output_tokens,cache_read_tokens,cache_write_tokens,cost_usd,pool_fraction_before,pool_fraction_after,at. kind enum task/probe/manual.\n\npool: required? \"kind 枚举..., funding 枚举..., window.reset_source 枚举..., capacity_mtok 为 map, credits_per_mtok 数值或 null\". The §6 example has id, cli, kind, funding, window{length_s,anchor,start_at,reset_at,reset_source}, capacity_mtok, used_fraction{value,source,at}, credits_per_mtok. \"示例里有值的字段全部 required\" — but some may be null. I'll require: id, cli, kind, funding, window, capacity_mtok, used_fraction, credits_per_mtok. Hmm, in config.v2 `pools: []` — $ref pool. Cases where pools entries may omit cli? For goldens policy pools are different shape (not validated by pool schema). For config example, I'll include a pool with all fields.\n\nRisk: pool.used_fraction may be null. Make it object|null.\n\nmodel.v1: required all keys from §10: schema,key,id,cli,provider,vendor,aliases,allowed,level,level_source,availability,identity,capabilities,prices,source,deprecated. Types. level null or enum Top/High/Middle/Quick? \"level 可 null\". I'll use enum including null: {\"enum\": [\"Top\",\"High\",\"Middle\",\"Quick\",null]}. availability object {state,reason,at,ttl_s,evidence}. Design: \"availability.state 取注册表 availability；availability.reason 与 availability.evidence 可 null\". Hmm availability object keys: state, reason, at, ttl_s, evidence. evidence object {probe_id, cmd_redacted, exit, duration_ms, nonce_ok, reported_model, tokens} or null.\n\nidentity: registry identity enum.\nlevel_source: {kind(config|measured|cli),ref,at} or null.\nsource: {kind enum subcommand/help/cache/api/manual, ref, at}.\ncapabilities: {context_tokens, readonly, stdin}.\nprices: {input_per_mtok, output_per_mtok, source}.\ndeprecated boolean.\n\ninventory.v1: required schema,generated_at,host,entries; host {platform,arch,wsl_distros}; entries elements: id, recognized, platform, path, realpath, version, fingerprint{size,mtime,realpath}, auth{state,source}, evidence[{kind,cmd_redacted,exit,at,digest}], first_seen,last_seen,status.\n\nconfig.v2: top-level required schema,state_dir,secrets,discovery,catalog,pools,policy; optional _example. secrets map values {ref} with ref pattern ^[a-z]+:.+$. discovery: extra_dirs array strings, wsl bool, probe_unknown bool, unknown_patterns array strings, cli_overrides object. catalog: allow array, levels object, aliases object, deprecated object, manual array. pools array of pool $ref. policy: required all keys listed: probe_ttl_s, lease_ttl_s, reading_ttl_s, lock_stale_ms, lock_wait_ms, lock_poll_ms, session_ttl_s, reserve_fraction_for_high, unknown_policy, usage_estimate_mtok, cache_read_weight, probe_schedule. usage_estimate_mtok map of Heavy/Normal/Light numbers. unknown_policy enum after_known/reject. probe_schedule null or string.\n\nsession.v1: required schema,session,csrf,expires_at; session/csrf pattern ^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$ minLength 20; expires_at ISO.\n\nerror-envelope: required ok (const false) and error{code,message,retryable,retry_after}. code enum 30 codes; retryable boolean; retry_after string|null.\n\nSpec schemas:\n\nregistry-snapshot: exact structure of §3.2. additionalProperties false at top. codes array items {code,exit,http_status,retryable,trigger_id,trigger} with code pattern ^E_[A-Z0-9_]+$? Careful: design says trigger_id pattern; for code I'll use pattern '^E_[A-Z0-9_]+$'. Hmm E_... all caps. Fine. But should I add pattern not specified? Design says snapshot structure; adding constraints is fine as long as real file validates. I'll keep minimal but useful: trigger_id pattern '^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$'.\n\nthresholds: object with tasks, fraction, priority. tasks/fraction array of {risk,op,value} where value number|null, op enum ['<=','<','else']. priority enum list.\n\nreject_reasons: v1 array of strings, admin_only, draft.\ndraft_reason_mapping array {draft,v1}.\nOther arrays of strings. snapshot_version integer minimum 1. But wait — AC-010 tests snapshot with version bumped; schema not involved.\n\nsurfaces: schema const, preserved array of {id,description,values?}, semantic_change array of {id,description}. additionalProperties false.\n\nmigration-map: schema const, draft_to_v1 {reasons:[{id,draft,v1}], fields:[{id,from,to,note}]}, config_v1_to_v2 [{id,from,to,note}].\n\ngolden: schema const, kind enum 8 kinds, description string, cases array of {id, fn?, input, expected}. Note `expected` can be any object; `input` any object. To validate, we need type object. additionalProperties false at top; case additionalProperties false with required id,input,expected, optional fn. input/expected: type object.\n\ngolden-manifest: schema const, files array of {path pattern ^contracts/(spec|golden)/, sha256 pattern ^[0-9a-f]{64}$}. additionalProperties false.\n\nac-index: as design.\n\nagentline-forbidden: schema const; keys array of strings (lowercase pattern ^[a-z0-9_]+$? keys like 'model_key','api_key','direct_call','env_names' — yes all lowercase alnum underscore). call object {keys array of 6 strings, input const 'stdin', output const 'cliworker.event/v1', args array of 8 strings}.\n\nNow examples. Let me write them.\n\n### request.v1 valid/01.json\n```json\n{\"schema\":\"cliworker.request/v1\",\"request_id\":\"r-001\",\"level\":\"Top\",\"count\":2,\"usage\":\"Heavy\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"require_readonly\":true,\"cwd\":\"C:/work/repo\",\"timeout_ms\":1800000,\"exclude_handles\":[\"h_1a2b\"]}\n```\nBut additionalProperties true so extra fields fine. Wait require_readonly/cwd/timeout_ms not in properties → allowed since additionalProperties true.\n\ninvalid/01: missing level → expect path \"/level\" keyword required.\ninvalid/02: count 0 → path \"/count\" keyword minimum.\n\n### handle.v1 valid/01\n```json\n{\"schema\":\"cliworker.handle/v1\",\"handle_id\":\"h_9f2c\",\"lease_id\":\"l_7d1e\",\"level\":\"Top\",\"label\":\"Top-1\",\"readonly\":true,\"expires_at\":\"2026-11-07T12:00:00Z\",\"call\":{\"command\":\"C:/Program Files/nodejs/node.exe\",\"args\":[\"C:/pkg/bin/cliworker.mjs\",\"run\",\"--lease\",\"l_7d1e\",\"--state-dir\",\"C:/state\",\"--config\",\"C:/config/cliworker.json\"],\"cwd\":\"C:/work/repo\",\"input\":\"stdin\",\"output\":\"cliworker.event/v1\",\"timeout_ms\":1800000}}\n```\ninvalid/01: handle_id \"H-1\" → pattern at /handle_id.\ninvalid/02: call missing input → required at /call/input.\n\nCheck \"示例里不得出现令牌样子\" — fine.\n\n### handle-full.v1 valid/01: base + detail.\ndetail: model_key, cli, vendor, funding, pools, forecast, direct_call.\n```json\n\"detail\":{\"model_key\":\"claude:claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"cli\":\"claude\",\"vendor\":\"anthropic\",\"funding\":\"plan\",\"pools\":[\"claude:plan-5h\"],\"forecast\":{},\"direct_call\":{\"command\":\"claude\",\"args\":[\"-p\",\"--model\",\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"--output-format\",\"stream-json\",\"--verbose\",\"--permission-mode\",\"plan\"],\"cwd\":\"C:/work/repo\",\"input\":\"stdin\",\"env_names\":[\"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\"]}}\n```\ninvalid/01: funding \"free\" → enum at /detail/funding.\ninvalid/02: detail missing direct_call → required at /detail/direct_call.\n\nhandle-full reuses $defs/call from handle.v1.schema.json: `\"call\": {\"$ref\":\"handle.v1.schema.json#/$defs/call\"}`. And handle.v1 defines $defs.call.\n\n### selection-ok.v1 valid/01: from §2.\n```json\n{\"schema\":\"cliworker.selection/v1\",\"ok\":true,\"request_id\":\"r-001\",\"level\":\"Top\",\"usage\":\"Heavy\",\"count_requested\":2,\"count_returned\":1,\"truncated\":true,\"shortfall\":1,\"models\":[<handle>],\"calls\":[<call>],\"rejected\":[{\"ref\":\"c3\",\"reason\":\"quota_low\"}],\"warnings\":[{\"code\":\"W_STALE_DATA\",\"ref\":\"c2\"}],\"error\":null,\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-07T10:00:00Z\"}\n```\nmodels[0] is handle v1 (full handle with schema). calls[0] = models[0].call deep equal.\n\ninvalid/01: reason \"quota\" → enum at /rejected/0/reason.\ninvalid/02: error field \"x\" but const null? error const null → path /error keyword const. Yes: `\"error\": {\"code\":...}` → const violation.\n\nHmm required? error required.\n\n### selection-failed.v1 valid/01 from §2.\n```json\n{\"schema\":\"cliworker.selection/v1\",\"ok\":false,\"request_id\":\"r-001\",\"models\":[],\"calls\":[],\"truncated\":false,\"shortfall\":2,\"rejected\":[],\"error\":{\"code\":\"E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA\",\"message\":\"...\",\"retryable\":true,\"retry_after\":\"2026-11-07T15:00:00Z\"}}\n```\ninvalid/01: models [{...}] → maxItems 0 at /models.\ninvalid/02: error.code \"E_NOPE\" → enum at /error/code.\n\n### event.v1 valid/01: {schema, seq, lease_id, type:'result', at, ok:true, exit_code:0, text:'done', usage:{input_tokens:1200,output_tokens:300}}. But type enum allows result. required schema,se