{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b6f3-66a9-7f84-93c2-7897e77b1994","session_id":"01a1b6ec-e364-796a-b544-183433e5f1dd","message":{"id":"01a1b6f366a97f8493c27895a239fda7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"14 files, F-1 ✓.\n\nNow check-write-scope.mjs.\n\nDesign details:\n- registry check always: files under contracts/spec/** and contracts/golden/** existing but not registered → FAIL write_scope.unregistered. manifest missing → FAIL write_scope.manifest_missing.\n- scope check when --scope or --scope-from: requires --base else exit 2.\n- changes = git diff --name-only --no-renames <base> + git ls-files --others --exclude-standard.\n- glob matching.\n- --scope-from parses YAML front matter.\n\nOutput on fail: `check-write-scope: FAILED (<K> errors)`.\n\nImplementation of git: spawnSync('git', args, {cwd: root, encoding:'utf8'}). If git fails → maybe report? If not a repo, exit? For F-6/F-7 no scope, no git.\n\nNote: F-8 runs with --base 93ebbb3 from repo root. Fine.\n\nAlso registry check uses manifest; if manifest missing AND unregistered files? Report both: design says manifest missing → FAIL write_scope.manifest_missing. If missing, can't compute unregistered... I'll just report manifest_missing and return? F-6 uses a valid manifest. Keep: if manifest missing → error and skip unregistered comparison.\n\nFront matter parsing: read file, lines; must start with `---`; find closing `---`; within, find line matching /^write_scope:\\s*$/; then subsequent lines matching /^\\s*-\\s+(.+)$/ until a non-list line. Return globs. If none → exit 2.\n\nNote design says \"读取 markdown 开头的 YAML front matter（以 --- 行开始和结束）\".\n\nNow, should paths from `git diff` include names with backslashes? No, git outputs posix.\n\nWrite it.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3","_messageId":"01a1b6f366a97f8493c27895a239fda7","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6f366a97f8493c27895a239fda7","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6f366a97f8493c27895a239fda7","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b6f3-66a9-7f84-93c2-7897e77b1994","traceparent":"00-e2db99401a709910f956cc03bd750ebc-3271128b70b8e57d-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6ec-e364-796a-b544-183433e5f1dd,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6ece74172df9c584a52539772f3"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:59:38.538Z"}
