ff → still ok.\n- F-17: ci.yml not listed.\nSo it's strictly beneficial for acceptance. The only violation is the letter of \"只改 write_scope 文件\". Hmm.\n\nBut wait: is this actually what the environment intends? Since a fresh worktree checkout with autocrlf=true would always be CRLF, this repo's check-ci test would always fail for everyone on Windows. Maybe the harness sets autocrlf=false for CI. The prior task (T-002) presumably passed acceptance on this machine... maybe it was run with a different config or the file was LF then. The git status currently shows nothing modified for ci.yml, so someone may have already touched it? No—CRLF present.\n\nHmm, let me check .gitattributes.\n\nAlso maybe check-ci has a flag or normalizes when env var set. Let me read check-ci.mjs and gen-ci.mjs quickly.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6fa65227f21b04060fc2217ec5b","_messageId":"01a1b6fbf17071df958c51645284e836","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6fa65227f21b04060fc2217ec5b","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6fbf17071df958c51645284e836","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6fbf17071df958c51645284e836","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b6fb-f170-71df-958c-5166a92c5087","traceparent":"00-1c5a28e5ce22516729d605f778f3c33e-0f3e64f261d56ec0-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b6fa-6086-7497-9211-6c5c62f23112,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b6fa65227f21b04060fc2217ec5b"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:08:56.654Z"}
