{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b6ff-3529-78a3-8960-0dd257ab1e56","session_id":"01a1b6fe-fae8-7ef3-a121-2a6d3b88b5a9","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_01_0pn0WBdOmL7FM9KCLhXA1554","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   1→# Task 001 验收标准\n   2→\n   3→规格来源：`design.md`（本目录）与 brief。brief 没有给基准 commit 或既有验收报告，所以写域检查以 `HEAD` 为基准；蓝图任务图为 `.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`。\n   4→\n   5→执行环境：仓库根（`C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\001`），PowerShell 7（`pwsh`），Node 20 或更高。所有命令在同一个 pwsh 会话里依次执行，先执行 §0 的辅助函数。「期望」一栏写的是命令的输出或退出码，任一条不符即该条不通过。\n   6→\n   7→## 0. 辅助函数（先执行一次）\n   8→\n   9→```powershell\n  10→function Run { $out = & node @args 2>&1; [pscustomobject]@{ Exit = $LASTEXITCODE; Out = ($out | Out-String) } }\n  11→function NewTmp { $d = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-acc-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N')); New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $d | Out-Null; $d }\n  12→```\n  13→\n  14→`Run` 返回 `Exit`（退出码）与 `Out`（stdout 加 stderr）。`NewTmp` 返回一个新的临时目录（在仓库之外）。\n  15→\n  16→## 1. 通用要求\n  17→\n  18→### V-01 写入范围\n  19→\n  20→```powershell\n  21→$allowed = @('^package\\.json$','^package-lock\\.json$','^scripts/run-tests\\.mjs$','^scripts/reporters/','^scripts/check-test-discovery\\.mjs$','^scripts/check-fast\\.mjs$','^scripts/check-fast\\.ps1$','^scripts/check-traceability\\.mjs$','^scripts/check-ci\\.mjs$','^scripts/gen-ci\\.mjs$','^scripts/ci-matrix\\.json$','^scripts/milestone-gate\\.mjs$','^scripts/check-defects\\.mjs$','^contracts/spec/ac-index\\.json$','^\\.github/workflows/','^test/select\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/unit/select\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/unit/runner-selftest\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/unit/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/unit/milestone-gate\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/helpers/platform-gate\\.mjs$','^test/fixtures/discovery-selftest/','^test/fixtures/traceability/','^test/fixtures/milestone-gate/','^test/characterization/defects/a3-runner\\.test\\.mjs$','^test/traceability/T-001\\.json$')\n  22→git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all | ForEach-Object { $_.Substring(3) -replace ' -> .*','' } | Where-Object { $_ -notmatch '^\\.collab/tasks/001/' } | Where-Object { $p = $_; -not ($allowed | Where-Object { $p -match $_ }) }\n  23→```\n  24→\n  25→期望：无任何输出（`.collab/tasks/001/` 下是调度器产物，不计）。跑过 `npm test` 之后仓库里也不应多出 `test-results/` 之类的文件，同一命令再执行一次仍无输出。\n  26→\n  27→### V-02 零第三方依赖与锁文件\n  28→\n  29→```powershell\n  30→node -p \"const p=require('./package.json'); ['dependencies','devDependencies','optionalDependencies','peerDependencies'].some(k=>k in p)\"\n  31→node -p \"JSON.stringify(Object.keys(require('./package-lock.json').packages))\"\n  32→```\n  33→\n  34→期望：第一条输出 `false`；第二条输出 `[\"\"]`（锁文件只含根包）。\n  35→\n  36→### V-03 `package.json` 的脚本\n  37→\n  38→```powershell\n  39→node -p \"JSON.stringify(require('./package.json').scripts)\"\n  40→```\n  41→\n  42→期望（逐字符一致）：`{\"test\":\"node scripts/run-tests.mjs\",\"check\":\"node scripts/check-fast.mjs\",\"perf\":\"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --perf\",\"snapshot:update\":\"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --update-snapshots\"}`\n  43→\n  44→### V-04 编码\n  45→\n  46→```powershell\n  47→git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all | ForEach-Object { $_.Substring(3) } | Where-Object { $_ -match '\\.(mjs|json|ps1|yml|md)$' -and $_ -notmatch '^\\.collab/' -and (Test-Path $_ -PathType Leaf) } | Where-Object { $b = [IO.File]::ReadAllBytes($_); ($b.Length -ge 3 -and $b[0] -eq 0xEF -and $b[1] -eq 0xBB -and $b[2] -eq 0xBF) -or ([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($b) -match \"`r\") }\n  48→```\n  49→\n  50→期望：无任何输出（没有带 BOM 或含 CR 的新文本文件）。\n  51→\n  52→### V-05 select 测试迁入\n  53→\n  54→```powershell\n  55→Test-Path test/select.test.mjs\n  56→Test-Path test/unit/select.test.mjs\n  57→node --test test/unit/select.test.mjs; $LASTEXITCODE\n  58→```\n  59→\n  60→期望：依次输出 `False`、`True`，第三条测试全部通过，最后一行输出 `0`。\n  61→\n  62→## 2. AC-001：运行器、完整与过滤模式\n  63→\n  64→### A1-01 完整运行\n  65→\n  66→```powershell\n  67→$o = NewTmp\n  68→npm test; $LASTEXITCODE\n  69→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --out-dir $o; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'run-tests: full'\n  70→```\n  71→\n  72→期望：`npm test` 的退出码为 `0`；第二段输出 `0`、`True`。\n  73→\n  74→### A1-02 完整运行的清单\n  75→\n  76→```powershell\n  77→node -p \"const m=require(process.argv[1]); [m.mode, m.filter, m.files.length>0, m.files.includes('test/unit/select.test.mjs'), m.files.includes('test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs'), m.files.some(f=>/^test\\/(fixtures|helpers|perf)\\//.test(f)), Object.keys(m).sort().join(',')].join('|')\" \"$o/files-executed.json\"\n  78→Test-Path \"$o/skips.jsonl\"\n  79→```\n  80→\n  81→期望：第一条输出 `full||true|true|true|false|files,filter,mode,node,platform`；第二条输出 `True`（`skips.jsonl` 即使没有跳过也存在）。\n  82→\n  83→### A1-03 过滤运行\n  84→\n  85→```powershell\n  86→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-074 --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n  87→node -p \"const m=require(process.argv[1]); [m.mode, m.filter, m.files.join(',')].join('|')\" \"$o/files-executed.json\"\n  88→```\n  89→\n  90→期望：第一条输出 `0`；第二条输出 `filtered|AC-074|test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs`。\n  91→\n  92→### A1-04 过滤运行的参数错误\n  93→\n  94→```powershell\n  95→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac foo --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n  96→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-999 --out-dir $o; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'run\\.no_match'\n  97→```\n  98→\n  99→期望：依次输出 `2`、`1`、`True`（找不到测试时不得以 0 退出）。\n 100→\n 101→### A1-05 夹具：完整运行当场校验，诱饵文件不被执行\n 102→\n 103→```powershell\n 104→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --root test/fixtures/discovery-selftest/ok --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n 105→node -p \"const m=require(process.argv[1]); [m.mode, m.files.join(',')].join('|')\" \"$o/files-executed.json\"\n 106→```\n 107→\n 108→期望：第一条输出 `0`（`test/fixtures`、`test/helpers`、`test/perf` 下的诱饵测试若被执行会使运行失败）；第二条输出 `full|test/flows/c.test.mjs,test/integration/b.test.mjs,test/unit/a.test.mjs`。\n 109→\n 110→### A1-06 夹具：过滤运行不做相等比较\n 111→\n 112→```powershell\n 113→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --root test/fixtures/discovery-selftest/ok --ac AC-001 --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n 114→node -p \"const m=require(process.argv[1]); [m.mode, m.filter, m.files.join(',')].join('|')\" \"$o/files-executed.json\"\n 115→```\n 116→\n 117→期望：输出 `0`，然后 `filtered|AC-001|test/unit/a.test.mjs`。\n 118→\n 119→### A1-07 夹具：孤儿测试文件\n 120→\n 121→```powershell\n 122→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --root test/fixtures/discovery-selftest/orphan --out-dir $o; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'discovery\\.orphan'; $r.Out -match 'test/loose\\.test\\.mjs'\n 123→```\n 124→\n 125→期望：依次输出 `1`、`True`、`True`。\n 126→\n 127→### A1-08 `check-test-discovery` 完整自测\n 128→\n 129→```powershell\n 130→$r = Run scripts/check-test-discovery.mjs; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'check-test-discovery: ok'\n 131→```\n 132→\n 133→期望：依次输出 `0`、`True`。\n 134→\n 135→### A1-09 `check-test-discovery` 能检出不一致，过滤清单不能顶替完整清单\n 136→\n 137→```powershell\n 138→$d = 'test/fixtures/discovery-selftest/drift'\n 139→foreach ($c in @(@('manifest-ok.json',0,$null), @('manifest-missing.json',1,'discovery\\.missing'), @('manifest-extra.json',1,'discovery\\.unexpected'), @('manifest-filtered.json',1,'discovery\\.mode_not_full'))) {\n 140→  $r = Run scripts/check-test-discovery.mjs --root $d --manifest \"$d/$($c[0])\"\n 141→  \"$($c[0]) exit=$($r.Exit) ok=$(($r.Exit -eq $c[1]) -and ($null -eq $c[2] -or $r.Out -match $c[2]))\"\n 142→}\n 143→```\n 144→\n 145→期望（四行，顺序一致）：\n 146→```\n 147→# manifest-ok.json exit=0 ok=True\n 148→# manifest-missing.json exit=1 ok=True\n 149→# manifest-extra.json exit=1 ok=True\n 150→# manifest-filtered.json exit=1 ok=True\n 151→```\n 152→\n 153→### A1-10 `--ac AC-001` 命中自测文件\n 154→\n 155→```powershell\n 156→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-001 --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n 157→node -p \"const m=require(process.argv[1]); m.mode+'|'+m.files.includes('test/unit/runner-selftest.test.mjs')\" \"$o/files-executed.json\"\n 158→```\n 159→\n 160→期望：输出 `0`，然后 `filtered|true`。\n 161→\n 162→### A1-11 嵌套运行不覆盖父运行产物\n 163→\n 164→```powershell\n 165→$env:CLIWORKER_RUN_ACTIVE = '1'; $env:CLIWORKER_RESULTS_DIR = $o\n 166→$r = Run scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-074 --out-dir $o; $r.Exit\n 167→Remove-Item Env:CLIWORKER_RUN_ACTIVE, Env:CLIWORKER_RESULTS_DIR\n 168→```\n 169→\n 170→期望：输出 `2`。\n 171→\n 172→### A1-12 `perf` 脚本\n 173→\n 174→```powershell\n 175→npm run perf; $LASTEXITCODE\n 176→```\n 177→\n 178→期望：退出码 `0`，输出含 `no perf tests`（`test/perf` 暂不存在）。该命令不得写 `files-executed.json`。\n 179→\n 180→### A1-13 平台门控的跳过记录格式\n 181→\n 182→```powershell\n 183→Select-String -Path test/helpers/platform-gate.mjs -SimpleMatch 'cliworker.skip/v1','platformTest','recordSkip','satisfies' | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Pattern -Unique | Sort-Object\n 184→```\n 185→\n 186→期望：输出 `cliworker.skip/v1`、`platformTest`、`recordSkip`、`satisfies` 四行（每个至少出现一次）。skip 记录的字段内容由 `runner-selftest` 中的 `[AC-001]` 测试断言，A1-10 已运行它。\n 187→\n 188→## 3. AC-002：CI 矩阵\n 189→\n 190→### A2-01 `check-ci` 通过\n 191→\n 192→```powershell\n 193→$r = Run scripts/check-ci.mjs; $r.Exit; $r.Out -match 'check-ci: ok'\n 194→```\n 195→\n 196→期望：依次输出 `0`、`True`。\n 197→\n 198→### A2-02 矩阵内容\n 199→\n 200→```powershell\n 201→node -p \"const m=require('./scripts/ci-matrix.json'); [m.os.map(o=>o.name).join(','), m.node.join(','), m.check_command, m.artifacts.join(','), m.perf.blocking].join('|')\"\n 202→```\n 203→\n 204→期望：输出 `ubuntu,windows,macos|20,22|npm run check|files-executed.json,skips.jsonl|false`。\n 205→\n 206→### A2-03 生成物里的关键内容\n 207→\n 208→```powershell\n 209→$y = '.github/workflows/ci.yml'\n 210→foreach ($s in 'continue-on-error: true','npm run check','actions/upload-artifact@v4','ubuntu-latest','windows-latest','macos-latest','files-executed.json','skips.jsonl','CLIWORKER_RESULTS_DIR') { \"$s => \" + ((Select-String -Path $y -SimpleMatch $s).Count -ge 1) }\n 211→(Select-String -Path $y -SimpleMatch 'continue-on-error: true').Count\n 212→(Select-String -Path $y -SimpleMatch 'needs:').Count\n 213→```\n 214→\n 215→期望：前九行的右侧都是 `True`；随后输出 `1`（只有 perf 作业不阻断）、`0`（没有作业依赖别的作业，perf 也不被依赖）。\n 216→\n 217→### A2-04 篡改检测\n 218→\n 219→```powershell\n 220→$t = NewTmp\n 221→New-Item -ItemType Directory \"$t/scripts\",\"$t/.github/workflows\" | Out-Null\n 222→Copy-Item scripts/ci-matrix.json \"$t/scripts/\"; Copy-Item .github/workflows/ci.yml \"$t/.github/workflows/\"\n 223→$r = Run scripts/check-ci.mjs --root $t; \"clean: $($r.Exit)\"\n 224→Add-Content \"$t/.github/workflows/ci.yml\" '# x'\n 225→$r = Run scripts/check-ci.mjs --root $t; \"stale: $($r.Exit) $($r.Out -match 'ci\\.stale')\"\n 226→Copy-Item .github/workflows/ci.yml \"$t/.github/workflows/ci.yml\" -Force\n 227→$m = Get-Content -Raw scripts/ci-matrix.json | ConvertFrom-Json; $m.perf.blocking = $true\n 228→$m | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8 | Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$t/scripts/ci-matrix.json\"\n 229→$r = Run scripts/check-ci.mjs --root $t; \"blocking: $($r.Exit) $($r.Out -match 'ci\\.matrix_invalid')\"\n 230→$m = Get-Content -Raw scripts/ci-matrix.json | ConvertFrom-Json; $m.node = @(20)\n 231→$m | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8 | Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$t/scripts/ci-matrix.json\"\n 232→$r = Run scripts/check-ci.mjs --root $t; \"node: $($r.Exit) $($r.Out -match 'ci\\.matrix_invalid')\"\n 233→```\n 234→\n 235→期望（四行）：\n 236→```\n 237→clean: 0\n 238→stale: 1 True\n 239→blocking: 1 True\n 240→node: 1 True\n 241→```\n 242→\n 243→## 4. AC-003：check-fast 与 pwsh 包装\n 244→\n 245→### A3-01 注入失败步骤：node 入口立即停止并透传退出码\n 246→\n 247→```powershell\n 248→$f = NewTmp; $log = Join-Path $f 'log.txt'\n 249→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/check-a.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'a\\n')\"\n 250→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/check-b.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'b\\n'); process.exit(7)\"\n 251→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/check-c.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'c\\n')\"\n 252→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/final.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'final\\n')\"\n 253→$env:CW_LOG = $log; $env:CLIWORKER_TEST_CHECK_DIR = $f; $env:CLIWORKER_TEST_FINAL_SCRIPT = \"$f/final.mjs\"\n 254→$r = Run scripts/check-fast.mjs\n 255→\"exit=$($r.Exit) names=$($r.Out -match 'check-b\\.mjs') log=$((Get-Content $log) -join ',')\"\n 256→```\n 257→\n 258→期望：`exit=7 names=True log=a,b`（`check-c` 与最后一步都没有执行；输出里含失败步骤名 `check-b.mjs`）。\n 259→\n 260→### A3-02 同一注入：pwsh 入口以同一个码退出\n 261→\n 262→```powershell\n 263→pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/check-fast.ps1; $LASTEXITCODE\n 264→```\n 265→\n 266→期望：命令输出里含 `check-b.mjs`，最后一行输出 `7`（与 A3-01 的 node 入口同码；此时环境变量沿用 A3-01 设置的值）。\n 267→\n 268→### A3-03 全部成功：字母序，不含自身，最后跑最后一步\n 269→\n 270→```powershell\n 271→Remove-Item $log\n 272→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/check-b.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'b\\n')\"\n 273→Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$f/check-fast.mjs\" \"import fs from 'node:fs'; fs.appendFileSync(process.env.CW_LOG, 'SELF\\n')\"\n 274→$r = Run scripts/check-fast.mjs\n 275→\"exit=$($r.Exit) log=$((Get-Content $log) -join ',')\"\n 276→```\n 277→\n 278→期望：`exit=0 log=a,b,c,final`（注入目录里名为 `check-fast.mjs` 的文件不被执行，最后一步在所有 check 之后）。\n 279→\n 280→### A3-04 清理注入变量\n 281→\n 282→```powershell\n 283→Remove-Item Env:CW_LOG, Env:CLIWORKER_TEST_CHECK_DIR, Env:CLIWORKER_TEST_FINAL_SCRIPT\n 284→```\n 285→\n 286→期望：无输出。之后 A3-05 及以后的命令必须在没有这些变量的环境里执行。\n 287→\n 288→### A3-05 pwsh 包装只有一层 node 调用\n 289→\n 290→```powershell\n 291→(Get-Content scripts/check-fast.ps1 | Where-Object { $_.Trim() -and -not $_.Trim().StartsWith('#') }).Count -le 3\n 292→(Select-String -Path scripts/check-fast.ps1 -SimpleMatch '$LASTEXITCODE').Count -ge 1\n 293→(Select-String -Path scripts/check-fast.ps1 -SimpleMatch 'check-fast.mjs').Count -ge 1\n 294→```\n 295→\n 296→期望：依次输出 `True`、`True`、`True`。\n 297→\n 298→### A3-06 真实运行\n 299→\n 300→```powershell\n 301→pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/check-fast.ps1; $LASTEXITCODE\n 302→npm run check; $LASTEXITCODE\n 303→```\n 304→\n 305→期望：两次退出码都为 `0`；输出里可见按字母序的 `==> check-ci.mjs`、`==> check-defe