{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b702-7622-7a9e-99ca-594d2a241aed","session_id":"01a1b6fe-fae8-7ef3-a121-2a6d3b88b5a9","message":{"id":"01a1b70266817021a9fb08d5463cf1f9","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_ET_4w9I8xj2YbJf0CggLvzY7592","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\004\\.collab\\tasks\\004\\impl.md","new_string":"### 6.2 G-4 的 null 呈现（已解决）\n\n`contracts/golden/forecast/quantiles.json` 的 `n2-invalid` / `n1-invalid` / `n0-invalid` 按 design §9.4 写成 `\"expected\": {\"value\": null}`（\"n<3 时 value 为 null\"）。上一轮的 G-4 命令用 `Array.prototype.join` 打印这四个值，`join` 把 `null` 渲染成空串，输出是 `0.3 3 18 `（末尾一个空格），与文中 `0.3 3 18 null` 差一个词。\n\n金标保持不变（`null` 才是 design §9.1 要求的下游深相等值），改的是验收命令：取值改成 `JSON.stringify(c.expected.value)`，于是 `0.3`、`3`、`18`、`null` 各自按 JSON 字面量呈现，输出恰为 `0.3 3 18 null`。这条命令同时把 `null` 与字符串 `\"null\"`、`undefined` 区分开，比原写法更严格。","old_string":"### 6.2 G-4 的逐字差异（design 与 acceptance 的冲突，按 design 处理）\n\n`contracts/golden/forecast/quantiles.json` 的 `n2-invalid` / `n1-invalid` / `n0-invalid` 按 design §9.4 写成 `\"expected\": {\"value\": null}`（\"n<3 时 value 为 null\"）。G-4 的命令用 `Array.prototype.join` 打印这四个值，`join` 把 `null` 渲染成空串，实际输出是 `0.3 3 18 `（末尾一个空格），与文中 `0.3 3 18 null` 差一个词。\n\n保留 `null` 的理由：design §9.1 规定金标 `expected` 与下游实测值**深相等**，T-006 消费这三个 case 时 `quantile_for_usage` 返回的就是 `null`；改成字符串 `\"null\"` 会让金标与被冻结的语义不一致，正是本任务要防止的缺陷。若验收坚持逐字匹配，改动只有三处值是 `\"null\"`，随后需依次运行 `node scripts/check-golden-frozen.mjs --write` 与 `node scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs`（manifest 与文档都含哈希）。"}}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":106805,"output_tokens":647,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":106624,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6feff49796cac64907b9aede7fa","_messageId":"01a1b70266817021a9fb08d5463cf1f9","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId"