ered`。\n  51→- 末行 `exit=0`。\n  52→- 输出里没有 `✖` 行。\n  53→\n  54→## B-1 AC-009 的测试标题齐全\n  55→\n  56→```powershell\n  57→$o = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-009 2>&1 | Out-String); $t = @('[AC-009] REGISTRY deep-equals contracts/registry.snapshot.json','[AC-009] every code has exit, http_status, retryable, trigger_id and trigger','[AC-009] trigger_id and trigger text are unique across the table','[AC-009] codes, exits and retryable flags match the frozen exit-code table','[AC-009] the five 403 codes have mutually exclusive triggers','[AC-009] write route order is session, readonly, csrf, body','[AC-009] resolveView applies the select view rules','[AC-009] lib/contract modules are pure and import nothing','[AC-009] every schema uses only supported keywords','[AC-009] every valid example passes its schema','[AC-009] every invalid example fails with exactly the declared path and keyword','[AC-009] every wire schema has one valid and two invalid examples','[AC-009] schema enums for codes, warnings and reject reasons equal the registry','[AC-009] validator reports the expected path for each supported keyword','[AC-009] examples carry no token-like strings'); \"missing=$(@($t | Where-Object { -not $o.Contains($_) }).Count)\"\n  58→```\n  59→\n  60→- 末行恰为 `missing=0`（design §11 的 15 个标题全部出现在测试输出里）。\n  61→\n  62→## B-2 AC-010 的测试标题齐全\n  63→\n  64→```powershell\n  65→$o = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-010 2>&1 | Out-String); $t = @('[AC-010] compareRegistry reports removed for a deleted code','[AC-010] compareRegistry reports removed and added for a renamed code','[AC-010] compareRegistry reports changed for a modified field','[AC-010] compareRegistry reports nothing for identical registries','[AC-010] checkFrozen fails for a deleted code, a renamed code and an added code with a stale snapshot','[AC-010] snapshot-update is a no-op on an unchanged registry','[AC-010] snapshot-update writes the snapshot only when snapshot_version is previous plus one','[AC-010] snapshot