golden file','[AC-073] check-write-scope reports changes outside the write scope','[AC-073] check-write-scope reads write_scope from markdown front matter','[AC-073] check-no-collab reports zero references in the repository','[AC-073] check-no-collab reports the violating fixture and passes the clean fixture','[AC-073] gen-contract-doc output equals the committed docs/contract.md','[AC-073] check-contract-doc fails on a stale document','[AC-073] snapshot contains every code, trigger, threshold, reason, mapping and semantic_change of interfaces section 5','[AC-073] new check scripts are discoverable by check-fast'); \"missing=$(@($t | Where-Object { -not $o.Contains($_) }).Count)\"\n  82→```\n  83→\n  84→- 末行恰为 `missing=0`（design §11 的 16 个标题全部出现在测试输出里）。\n  85→\n  86→## C-1 注册表与快照深相等\n  87→\n  88→```powershell\n  89→node --input-type=module -e \"import {REGISTRY} from './lib/contract/registry.mjs'; import fs from 'node:fs'; import assert from 'node:assert/strict'; assert.deepStrictEqual(JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(REGISTRY)), JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('contracts/registry.snapshot.json','utf8'))); console.log('equal')\"\n  90→```\n  91→\n  92→- 输出为 `equal`，退出码 `0`。\n  93→\n  94→## C-2 快照的版本、码数与唯一性\n  95→\n  96→```powershell\n  97→node -e \"const s=JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('contracts/registry.snapshot.json','utf8'));const c=s.codes;console.log([s.snapshot_version,c.length,new Set(c.map(x=>x.trigger_id)).size,new Set(c.map(x=>x.trigger)).size,c.filter(x=>x.retryable).map(x=>x.code).join('+')].join(' '))\"\n  98→```\n  99→\n 100→- 输出逐字为 `1 30 30 30 E_TIMEOUT+E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA+E_LEASE_EXPIRED`。\n 101→\n 102→## C-3 五个 403 码的退出码与触发编号\n 103→\n 104→```powershell\n 105→node -e \"const c=require('./contracts/registry.snapshot.json').codes.filter(x=>x.http_status===403);console.log(c.map(x=>x.code+':'+x.exit+':'+x.trigger_id).join(' '))\"\n 106→```\n 107→\n 108→- 输出逐字为 `E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN:2:select_view_without_admin E_ADMIN_REQUIRED:8:admin_route_no_session E_LOOPBACK_ONLY:8:bootstrap_non_loopback E_READONLY:8:write_route_readonly E_CSRF:8:write_route_csrf_invalid`。\n 109→\n 110→## C-4 写路由判定顺序\n 111→\n 112→```powershell\n 113→node -e \"const s=require('./contracts/registry.snapshot.json');console.log(s.write_route_order.join(','))\"\n 114→```\n 115→\n 116→- 输出逐字为 `session,readonly,csrf,body`。\n 117→\n 118→## C-5 示例目录的 14 组正反例\n 119→\n 120→```powershell\n 121→node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const d='contracts/examples';const names=fs.readdirSync(d).sort();console.log(names.length, names.every(n=>fs.readdirSync(d+'/'+n+'/valid').length>=1 && fs.readdirSync(d+'/'+n+'/invalid').length>=2)); console.log(names.join(' '))\"\n 122→```\n 123→\n 124→- 第一行逐字为 `14 true`。\n 125→- 第二行逐字为 `config.v2 error-envelope event.v1 forecast.v1 handle-full.v1 handle.v1 inventory.v1 model.v1 pool request.v1 selection-failed.v1 selection-ok.v1 session.v1 usage.v1`。\n 126→\n 127→## C-6 schema 文件数量\n 128→\n 129→```powershell\n 130→node -e \"console.log(require('fs').readdirSync('contracts/schemas').filter(n=>n.endsWith('.schema.json')).length)\"\n 131→```\n 132→\n 133→- 输出逐字为 `21`。\n 134→\n 135→## C-7 注册表模块零 import\n 136→\n 137→```powershell\n 138→Select-String -Path lib/contract/registry.mjs -Pattern '^\\s*import\\s'\n 139→```\n 140→\n 141→- 无任何输出。\n 142→\n 143→## C-8 lib/contract 纯函数性\n 144→\n 145→```powershell\n 146→Select-String -Path lib/contract/*.mjs -Pattern 'node:|Date\\.now|new Date|setTimeout|setInterval|setImmediate|process\\.env'\n 147→```\n 148→\n 149→- 无任何输出。\n 150→\n 151→## D-1 compareRegistry 的 removed、renamed 与 identical\n 152→\n 153→```powershell\n 154→node --input-type=module -e \"import {REGISTRY as r, compareRegistry as cmp} from './lib/contract/registry.mjs'; const a=structuredClone(r); a.codes=a.codes.filter(c=>c.code!=='E_CSRF'); const b=structuredClone(r); b.codes=b.codes.map(c=>c.code==='E_CSRF'?{...c,code:'E_CSRF2'}:c); console.log(JSON.stringify(cmp(r,a))); console.log(JSON.stringify(cmp(r,b))); console.log(JSON.stringify(cmp(r,structuredClone(r))))\"\n 155→```\n 156→\n 157→- 第一行 `{\"removed\":[\"codes:E_CSRF\"],\"added\":[],\"changed\":[]}`。\n 158→- 第二行 `{\"removed\":[\"codes:E_CSRF\"],\"added\":[\"codes:E_CSRF2\"],\"changed\":[]}`。\n 159→- 第三行 `{\"removed\":[],\"added\":[],\"changed\":[]}`。\n 160→\n 161→## D-2 snapshot-update 在未改动注册表上是空操作\n 162→\n 163→```powershell\n 164→node scripts/snapshot-update.mjs; \"exit=$LASTEXITCODE\"\n 165→```\n 166→\n 167→- 首行 `snapshot-update: unchanged (snapshot_version 1)`，末行 `exit=0`。\n 168→- 运行后 `contracts/registry.snapshot.json` 未被改写（`git status --short -- contracts/registry.snapshot.json` 与运行前相同）。\n 169→\n 170→## D-3 快照的枚举、映射与阈值计数\n 171→\n 172→```powershell\n 173→node -e \"const s=require('./contracts/registry.snapshot.json');console.log([s.reject_reasons.v1.length,s.reject_reasons.admin_only.join(),s.reject_reasons.draft.length,s.draft_reason_mapping.length,s.warning_codes.length,s.forecast_reasons.length,s.risk.length,s.risk_basis.length,s.tasks_left_basis.length,s.availability.length,s.identity.length,s.semantic_change.join('+'),s.thresholds.tasks.length,s.thresholds.fraction.length,s.thresholds.priority.join('>')].join(' '))\"\n 174→```\n 175→\n 176→- 输出逐字为 `15 not_allowed 7 10 8 7 5 4 3 5 3 forecast.tasks_left+forecast.risk+handle.cli_removed+draft_reason_mapping+config_v1_to_v2 4 4 tasks>usd>fraction>unknown`。\n 177→\n 178→## D-4 两张阈值表的边界\n 179→\n 180→```powershell\n 181→node -e \"const t=require('./contracts/registry.snapshot.json').thresholds;console.log(JSON.stringify(t.tasks.map(x=>[x.risk,x.op,x.value])));console.log(JSON.stringify(t.fraction.map(x=>[x.risk,x.op,x.value])))\"\n 182→```\n 183→\n 184→- 第一行 `[[\"exhausted\",\"<=\",0],[\"critical\",\"<=\",2],[\"low_reserve\",\"<=\",5],[\"ok\",\"else\",null]]`。\n 185→- 第二行 `[[\"exhausted\",\"<=\",0],[\"critical\",\"<\",0.05],[\"low_reserve\",\"<\",0.15],[\"ok\",\"else\",null]]`。\n 186→\n 187→## E-1 禁用键配置的形态\n 188→\n 189→```powershell\n 190→node -e \"const f=require('./contracts/agentline-forbidden.json');console.log(f.schema, f.keys.length, f.keys.every(k=>k===k.toLowerCase()), f.keys.includes('detail'), f.call.keys.join(','), f.call.args.length)\"\n 191→```\n 192→\n 193→- 输出逐字为 `cliworker.agentline-forbidden/v1 25 true false command,args,cwd,input,output,timeout_ms 8`。\n 194→\n 195→## E-2 禁用键与禁用值的命中路径\n 196→\n 197→```powershell\n 198→node --input-type=module -e \"import {scanView} from './lib/contract/scan.mjs'; import fs from 'node:fs'; const forbidden=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('contracts/agentline-forbidden.json','utf8')); const catalog={models:[{key:'k:zeta-model-9',id:'zeta-model-9',cli:'zetacli'}]}; const w={command:'node',bin:'bin/cliworker.mjs',state_dir:'/s',config:'/c'}; const hit=scanView({a:{b:{Model_Key:'x'}}},{forbidden,catalog,wrapper:w}); const val=scanView({a:[{m:'use zeta-model-9 now'}]},{forbidden,catalog,wrapper:w}); const clean=scanView({note:'cliworker config dsh-CLIWorker'},{forbidden,catalog,wrapper:w}); console.log(JSON.stringify(hit.hits.map(h=>[h.path,h.kind]))); console.log(JSON.stringify(val.hits.map(h=>[h.path,h.kind]))); console.log(clean.ok, clean.hits.length)\"\n 199→```\n 200→\n 201→- 第一行 `[[\"/a/b/Model_Key\",\"forbidden_key\"]]`。\n 202→- 第二行 `[[\"/a/0/m\",\"forbidden_value\"]]`。\n 203→- 第三行 `true 0`。\n 204→\n 205→## E-3 call 子树的模板比对\n 206→\n 207→```powershell\n 208→node --input-type=module -e \"import {scanView} from './lib/contract/scan.mjs'; import fs from 'node:fs'; const forbidden=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('contracts/agentline-forbidden.json','utf8')); const catalog={models:[{key:'k:zeta-model-9',id:'zeta-model-9',cli:'zetacli'}]}; const w={command:'node',bin:'bin/cliworker.mjs',state_dir:'/s',config:'/c'}; const call=(over)=>({command:'node',args:['bin/cliworker.mjs','run','--lease','l_abc','--state-dir','/s','--config','/c'],cwd:'C:/work/zeta-model-9',input:'stdin',output:'cliworker.event/v1',timeout_ms:1000,...over}); const v=(c)=>({models:[{lease_id:'l_abc',call:c}],calls:[c]}); const ok=scanView(v(call({})),{forbidden,catalog,wrapper:w}); const bad=scanView(v(call({command:'zetacli'})),{forbidden,catalog,wrapper:w}); console.log(ok.ok, bad.ok, [...new Set(bad.hits.map(h=>h.kind))].join())\"\n 209→```\n 210→\n 211→- 输出逐字为 `true false call_mismatch`（`cwd` 含模型 id 不算命中；`command` 被改只报 `call_mismatch`）。\n 212→\n 213→## F-1 金标冻结检查通过\n 214→\n 215→```powershell\n 216→node scripts/check-golden-frozen.mjs; \"exit=$LASTEXITCODE\"\n 217→```\n 218→\n 219→- 首行 `check-golden-frozen: ok (14 files)`，末行 `exit=0`。\n 220→\n 221→## F-2 金标清单的内容\n 222→\n 223→```powershell\n 224→node -e \"const m=require('./contracts/golden/manifest.json');console.log(m.schema, m.files.length, m.files.some(f=>f.path.endsWith('manifest.json')), m.files.some(f=>f.path==='contracts/spec/ac-index.json'), m.files.some(f=>f.path==='contracts/registry.snapshot.json'), m.files.every(f=>f.sha256.length===64 && f.sha256===f.sha256.toLowerCase()), JSON.stringify(m.files.map(f=>f.path))===JSON.stringify(m.files.map(f=>f.path).sort()))\"\n 225→```\n 226→\n 227→- 输出逐字为 `cliworker.golden-manifest/v1 14 false true false true true`。\n 228→\n 229→## F-3 修改金标后冻结检查失败\n 230→\n 231→```powershell\n 232→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'ac073-mod'; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; New-Item -ItemType Directory $t | Out-Null; Copy-Item contracts -Destination $t -Recurse; Add-Content \"$t/contracts/golden/b44.json\" ' '; node scripts/check-golden-frozen.mjs --root $t; \"exit=$LASTEXITCODE\"; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force\n 233→```\n 234→\n 235→- 输出含 `FAIL golden.changed contracts/golden/b44.json`。\n 236→- 输出含 `check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)`，`exit=1`。\n 237→\n 238→## F-4 新增金标后冻结检查失败\n 239→\n 240→```powershell\n 241→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'ac073-add'; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; New-Item -ItemType Directory $t | Out-Null; Copy-Item contracts -Destination $t -Recurse; Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$t/contracts/golden/extra.json\" '{}'; n